    "AI でツールを作るコストとハードルは大きく下がった": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI has greatly lowered the cost and hurdle of building tools"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI で増えるエンジニアのアウトプットに対して、QA の負荷を減らしたい": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "As AI boosts engineering output, reduce the load on QA"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI に修正させる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "handed to AI"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI に修正させるための正確なコンテキストとして、そのまま渡せるチケットにしたい": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tickets that can be handed to AI as accurate context for the fix"
