        }
      }
    },
    "AI に修正を頼むとき": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "asking AI to fix it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI に修正を頼むときも、どの Widget かが正確に直させる材料になる": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When asking AI to fix it, the exact Widget is key context"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI は機能開発だけでなく、効率化や QA の負荷削減にも": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use AI beyond features: for efficiency and a lighter QA load"
